{
  "title": { "zh": "取一个" },
  "adds": ["allE"],
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新元件<part-ref to=\"part:allE\"></part-ref>：接进「∀x. …」，在元件上选一样东西，输出就是把 x 换成它的那句话。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "q-allE",
      "kind": "proof",
      "consts": ["i"],
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "∀x. P(x) → Q(x)", "q": "P(i)" }, "goal": "Q(i)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Human", "Q": "Mortal" }, { "P": "Student", "Q": "School" }],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "「对所有 x」说的话，对安也成立：在元件上把 x 换成安。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["e = allE[t=i](p)", "m = mp(e, q)", "goal <- m"]
    }
  ]
}
